{"title":"Career Roadmap · Crypto Analyst","role":"Crypto Analyst","summary":"A Crypto Analyst researches and analyses digital assets, blockchain networks, token economics, market behaviour, on-chain activity, protocols, risks, and broader Web3 ecosystems. Depending on the employer, the role can combine financial analysis + blockchain analytics + data analysis + research.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BCA – Blockchain / Web3"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Blockchain Intern, Web3 Research Intern, Crypto Research Intern, Junior Blockchain Analyst"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Crypto Analyst, Blockchain Research Analyst, On-chain Analyst, Digital Asset Research Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Crypto Analyst, Digital Asset Researcher, Protocol Analyst, Investment/Research Lead"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Research Director, Digital Asset Strategy Lead, Head of Research, Blockchain Analytics Lead"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA student specialising in Blockchain / Web3, the strongest route is to combine blockchain technology + Python/SQL + statistics + financial markets + on-chain analytics + risk analysis."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Crypto Analyst” can mean different things across employers. Some roles focus on investment/market research, while others focus on blockchain/on-chain data, protocol research, compliance or risk. The roadmap therefore builds a broad analytical foundation rather than treating it as a single job type."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong alignment, provided the student adds finance, statistics and data-analysis skills to the technical blockchain curriculum."},{"type":"p","text":"A practical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain/Web3","Blockchain/Data Research Intern","Crypto/Blockchain Research Analyst","Crypto Analyst","Senior Analyst","Research Lead / Investment Analyst / On-chain Analytics Lead"]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python, statistics, mathematics, financial-market basics"},{"text":"Python Documentation · Khan Academy","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"text":"Python data-analysis exercises"},{"text":"Analytical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"SQL, Excel, probability, economics, blockchain fundamentals"},{"text":"Bitcoin Developer Documentation","url":"https://developer.bitcoin.org/"},{"text":"Blockchain data analysis project"},{"text":"Data + blockchain foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Ethereum, smart contracts, wallets, transactions, tokens"},{"text":"Ethereum Developers","url":"https://ethereum.org/developers/"},{"text":"Ethereum transaction analysis"},{"text":"Blockchain understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"On-chain analytics, APIs, SQL, dashboards"},{"text":"Dune","url":"https://dune.com/"},{"text":"On-chain dashboard"},{"text":"Analytics capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Tokenomics, DeFi, stablecoins, protocols, market structure"},{"text":"Official protocol documentation + research papers"},{"text":"Protocol research report"},{"text":"Research depth"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Risk, valuation, compliance concepts, advanced analytics"},{"text":"Regulatory/official financial resources"},{"text":"Digital-asset risk report"},{"text":"Professional analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Internship + specialisation + research portfolio"},{"text":"Industry data/research platforms"},{"text":"Internship + published research"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Interview preparation + portfolio + final-year research"},{"text":"Research papers + market datasets"},{"text":"3–5 analytical projects"},{"text":"Placement readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Python should become the main analytical programming language."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables and data structures"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"OOP"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"Python Documentation\nNumPy\npandas\nscikit-learn","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"}]},{"heading":"SQL and blockchain data","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is extremely valuable for on-chain analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Date/time analysis"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Query optimisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use SQL to investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wallet activity"},{"text":"Transaction volumes"},{"text":"Token transfers"},{"text":"Protocol usage"},{"text":"User growth"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Liquidity"},{"text":"DEX activity"},{"text":"Contract interactions"}]}]},{"heading":"Blockchain fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand deeply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Bitcoin"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blocks"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"UTXO model"},{"text":"Mining"},{"text":"Consensus"},{"text":"Hashing"},{"text":"Addresses"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Halving"},{"text":"Network activity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ethereum"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounts"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Gas"},{"text":"Smart contracts"},{"text":"EVM"},{"text":"Tokens"},{"text":"ERC standards"},{"text":"Events/logs"},{"text":"Layer 2 concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Official resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"Bitcoin Developer Documentation\nEthereum Developers","url":"https://developer.bitcoin.org/"}]},{"heading":"On-chain analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important technical skills for a modern Crypto Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active addresses"},{"text":"New addresses"},{"text":"Transaction volume"},{"text":"Token transfers"},{"text":"Exchange flows"},{"text":"Whale activity"},{"text":"Gas usage"},{"text":"Protocol fees"},{"text":"TVL"},{"text":"Liquidity"},{"text":"Stablecoin supply"},{"text":"DEX volume"},{"text":"Lending activity"},{"text":"Borrowing"},{"text":"Liquidations"},{"text":"Bridge activity"},{"text":"Smart-contract interactions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools/platforms to explore include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dune"},{"text":"Etherscan"},{"text":"DefiLlama"},{"text":"The Graph"},{"text":"Blockchain RPC/API providers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Dune\nEtherscan\nDefiLlama","url":"https://dune.com/"}]},{"heading":"Financial markets","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A technically strong blockchain student can still struggle as a Crypto Analyst without financial knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Equity markets"},{"text":"Fixed income basics"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"Commodities"},{"text":"Monetary policy"},{"text":"Interest rates"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Market cycles"},{"text":"Liquidity"},{"text":"Risk and return"},{"text":"Portfolio concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For digital assets additionally understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market capitalisation"},{"text":"Fully diluted valuation"},{"text":"Circulating supply"},{"text":"Token unlocks"},{"text":"Vesting"},{"text":"Emissions"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Deflation"},{"text":"Liquidity"},{"text":"Market depth"},{"text":"Trading volume"}]}]},{"heading":"Tokenomics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyse a token's economic structure."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Token supply"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Vesting"},{"text":"Unlock schedules"},{"text":"Emissions"},{"text":"Utility"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Staking"},{"text":"Incentives"},{"text":"Treasury"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Protocol fees"},{"text":"Burn mechanisms"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Concentration"},{"text":"Insider allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good tokenomics analysis should answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who owns the tokens?"},{"type":"p","text":"Why does the token have utility?"},{"type":"p","text":"How does supply change?"},{"type":"p","text":"What creates demand?"},{"type":"p","text":"What happens when tokens unlock?"}]},{"heading":"DeFi","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Decentralised exchanges"},{"text":"Automated market makers"},{"text":"Lending"},{"text":"Borrowing"},{"text":"Stablecoins"},{"text":"Staking"},{"text":"Liquid staking"},{"text":"Yield mechanisms"},{"text":"Bridges"},{"text":"Oracles"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Liquidity pools"},{"text":"Derivatives"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on understanding how protocols work economically and technically, not merely tracking token prices."}]},{"heading":"Data visualisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Python visualisation"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Time-series charts"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards showing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Network activity","protocol usage","liquidity","revenue","token behaviour"]},{"type":"p","text":"A Crypto Analyst must be able to convert large datasets into a clear investment/research narrative."}]},{"heading":"Statistics and quantitative analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Volatility"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Outlier detection"},{"text":"Backtesting concepts"},{"text":"Factor analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the critical distinction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Correlation ≠ causation"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not present trading indicators or historical relationships as guaranteed future returns."}]},{"heading":"Research and financial analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project fundamentals"},{"text":"Team"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Treasury"},{"text":"Tokenomics"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Adoption"},{"text":"Regulatory risk"},{"text":"Smart-contract risk"},{"text":"Liquidity risk"},{"text":"Market risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A professional research report should contain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Thesis","Evidence","Data","Risks","Counterarguments","Conclusion"]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Bitcoin On-Chain Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction count"},{"text":"Active addresses"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Block activity"},{"text":"Transaction volume"},{"text":"Network trends"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python/SQL and visualise the results."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Ethereum Wallet Behaviour Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study an authorised/public blockchain dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction frequency"},{"text":"Gas usage"},{"text":"Contract interactions"},{"text":"Token transfers"},{"text":"Wallet activity patterns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not claim that a wallet belongs to a particular individual without reliable evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — DeFi Protocol Research Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a public protocol and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product"},{"text":"Users"},{"text":"TVL"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Tokenomics"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Competitive landscape"},{"text":"Risks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a professional 10–15 page research report."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Tokenomics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circulating supply"},{"text":"Total supply"},{"text":"Unlock schedule"},{"text":"Emissions"},{"text":"Market capitalisation"},{"text":"FDV"},{"text":"Holder concentration"},{"text":"Treasury information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Crypto Market Analytics System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market data","Python","database","statistical analysis","dashboard","research report"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Volume"},{"text":"Volatility"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Market regime"},{"text":"On-chain metrics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to demonstrate analysis rather than price prediction."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"On-chain Analytics"},{"text":"SQL, Python, blockchain data"},{"text":"Senior On-chain Analyst"}],[{"text":"Digital Asset Research"},{"text":"Finance, tokenomics, research"},{"text":"Digital Asset Research Lead"}],[{"text":"DeFi Research"},{"text":"DeFi, economics, data"},{"text":"DeFi Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"Tokenomics"},{"text":"Economics, statistics, blockchain"},{"text":"Tokenomics Specialist"}],[{"text":"Crypto Risk"},{"text":"Risk, analytics, compliance"},{"text":"Digital Asset Risk Analyst"}],[{"text":"Blockchain Intelligence"},{"text":"On-chain data, graph analytics"},{"text":"Blockchain Intelligence Analyst"}],[{"text":"Crypto Investment Research"},{"text":"Finance, valuation, markets"},{"text":"Digital Asset Investment Analyst"}],[{"text":"Protocol Research"},{"text":"Blockchain architecture + economics"},{"text":"Protocol Researcher"}],[{"text":"Compliance Analytics"},{"text":"Blockchain + AML/data analysis"},{"text":"Crypto Compliance Analyst"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector / research"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation/type","What to target"],"rows":[[{"text":"RBI"},{"text":"FinTech, payments, financial-system research and technology-related opportunities where available"}],[{"text":"SEBI ecosystem"},{"text":"Capital markets, market research and regulatory technology exposure where available"}],[{"text":"NITI Aayog"},{"text":"Digital economy, emerging technology and policy research"}],[{"text":"Academic blockchain labs"},{"text":"Blockchain research, economics, cryptography and data analysis"}],[{"text":"IIT/IISc research groups"},{"text":"Distributed systems, blockchain, cryptography, economics and AI"}],[{"text":"Financial research institutions"},{"text":"Quantitative/data research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"RBI\nSEBI\nNITI Aayog\nIISc","url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Availability and eligibility should be checked against current official notifications."},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blockchain analytics companies"},{"text":"Web3 companies"},{"text":"Crypto research firms"},{"text":"Digital-asset exchanges"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Blockchain infrastructure companies"},{"text":"DeFi protocols"},{"text":"Investment research firms"},{"text":"Risk/compliance companies"},{"text":"Blockchain intelligence companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples to research include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coinbase","url":"https://www.coinbase.com/"},{"text":"Chainalysis","url":"https://www.chainalysis.com/"},{"text":"Consensys","url":"https://consensys.io/"},{"text":"CoinMarketCap","url":"https://coinmarketcap.com/"},{"text":"CoinGecko","url":"https://www.coingecko.com/"},{"text":"Binance","url":"https://www.binance.com/"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Current vacancies, country restrictions and legal/regulatory requirements vary, so use the official careers pages."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"NPTEL Blockchain courses"},{"text":"Academic blockchain foundation"}],[{"text":"Blockchain developer certification"},{"text":"Technical understanding"}],[{"text":"Python data-analysis certification"},{"text":"Analytics capability"}],[{"text":"SQL certification"},{"text":"On-chain data analysis"}],[{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Investment/research roles"}],[{"text":"CFA curriculum/qualification"},{"text":"Strong finance foundation where relevant"}],[{"text":"FRM"},{"text":"Risk-management pathway"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Analytics dashboards"}],[{"text":"Data analytics certification"},{"text":"Research/data roles"}],[{"text":"FinTech certification"},{"text":"Finance + technology"}],[{"text":"Blockchain analytics training"},{"text":"On-chain analysis"}],[{"text":"AML/CFT fundamentals"},{"text":"Compliance/risk pathway"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a pure Crypto Analyst route, finance/data skills usually matter more than collecting blockchain-development certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Crypto Research Intern"},{"text":"Blockchain, markets, research"},{"text":"Research report"}],[{"text":"Blockchain Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Blockchain + SQL"},{"text":"On-chain dashboard"}],[{"text":"On-chain Analytics Intern"},{"text":"SQL, Python, blockchain data"},{"text":"Dune/Python project"}],[{"text":"Junior Crypto Analyst"},{"text":"Markets, data, blockchain"},{"text":"Portfolio"}],[{"text":"Blockchain Research Analyst"},{"text":"Protocols, tokenomics, research"},{"text":"Protocol reports"}],[{"text":"Digital Asset Analyst"},{"text":"Finance + crypto markets"},{"text":"Financial analysis"}],[{"text":"On-chain Analyst"},{"text":"SQL, blockchain datasets"},{"text":"Analytics dashboard"}],[{"text":"DeFi Analyst"},{"text":"DeFi + financial analysis"},{"text":"DeFi research"}],[{"text":"Tokenomics Analyst"},{"text":"Economics + blockchain"},{"text":"Tokenomics report"}],[{"text":"Crypto Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Risk + data + blockchain"},{"text":"Risk framework"}],[{"text":"Blockchain Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"On-chain data + analytics"},{"text":"Public-data project"}],[{"text":"Crypto Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Blockchain + AML/compliance"},{"text":"Compliance case study"}],[{"text":"Web3 Research Associate"},{"text":"Research + blockchain"},{"text":"Research portfolio"}],[{"text":"Digital Asset Research Associate"},{"text":"Finance + crypto"},{"text":"Investment research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"The title “Crypto Analyst” is not standardised."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the employer, the same underlying skills may be advertised as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Asset Analyst"},{"text":"Blockchain Analyst"},{"text":"On-chain Analyst"},{"text":"Web3 Research Analyst"},{"text":"Crypto Research Associate"},{"text":"Digital Asset Research Associate"},{"text":"DeFi Analyst"},{"text":"Tokenomics Analyst"},{"text":"Blockchain Intelligence Analyst"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, students should search across all of these titles."},{"type":"h","text":"Important finance and regulatory distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A Crypto Analyst is not automatically an investment adviser, portfolio manager, broker or financial adviser."},{"type":"p","text":"If the role involves regulated financial activity, investment advice or dealing with customer assets, the applicable laws, employer controls and regulatory requirements must be followed."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market integrity"},{"text":"Market manipulation concepts"},{"text":"AML/KYC fundamentals"},{"text":"Fraud risks"},{"text":"Sanctions considerations"},{"text":"Consumer protection"},{"text":"Custody risks"},{"text":"Conflicts of interest"},{"text":"Disclosure"},{"text":"Regulatory uncertainty"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never present a student research project as licensed financial advice."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Advanced computing + blockchain"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Blockchain Technology"},{"text":"Dedicated blockchain pathway"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Computer Science"},{"text":"Technical blockchain systems"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"On-chain analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"Quantitative analysis"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Financial Technology / FinTech"},{"text":"Finance + technology"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Finance"},{"text":"Digital-asset research"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Economics"},{"text":"Tokenomics and economic analysis"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Investment/financial research"}],[{"text":"MBA FinTech"},{"text":"Finance + blockchain"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data-driven research"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Blockchain/Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Technical blockchain research"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Computer Science"},{"text":"Distributed systems/cryptography"}],[{"text":"PhD Blockchain/Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Research"}],[{"text":"PhD Finance/Economics"},{"text":"Digital-asset economics research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best PG combinations"},{"type":"p","text":"For technical + analytical:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain","M.Sc Data Science / M.Tech CS","On-chain Analytics"]},{"type":"p","text":"For finance + research:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain","MBA Finance / M.Sc Finance","Digital Asset Research"]},{"type":"p","text":"For economics/tokenomics:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain","Economics/Finance PG","Tokenomics Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarships and research routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PMRF for eligible doctoral programmes"},{"text":"UGC/CSIR fellowships where applicable"},{"text":"Institute-funded research"},{"text":"University assistantships"},{"text":"Fulbright programmes"},{"text":"DAAD programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"PMRF\nUSIEF / Fulbright-Nehru\nDAAD India","url":"https://www.pmrf.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and funding vary by programme."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities","Relevant areas","Funding route"],"rows":[[{"text":"🇺🇸 USA"},{"text":"Carnegie Mellon, University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, Cornell, NYU"},{"text":"FinTech, CS, blockchain, financial engineering"},{"text":"University funding, assistantships"}],[{"text":"🇬🇧 UK"},{"text":"Imperial College London, UCL, University of Edinburgh"},{"text":"FinTech, blockchain, finance, data science"},{"text":"University scholarships"}],[{"text":"🇩🇪 Germany"},{"text":"TUM, Frankfurt School, Saarland University"},{"text":"FinTech, CS, distributed systems"},{"text":"DAAD, university funding"}],[{"text":"🇨🇦 Canada"},{"text":"University of Toronto, Waterloo, UBC"},{"text":"CS, FinTech, data science"},{"text":"University scholarships"}],[{"text":"🇸🇬 Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, Singapore Management University"},{"text":"FinTech, CS, financial analytics"},{"text":"University scholarships"}],[{"text":"🇨🇭 Switzerland"},{"text":"ETH Zurich, University of Zurich"},{"text":"CS, finance, distributed systems"},{"text":"University funding"}],[{"text":"🇳🇱 Netherlands"},{"text":"TU Delft, University of Amsterdam"},{"text":"CS, AI, financial technology"},{"text":"Institutional funding"}],[{"text":"🇦🇺 Australia"},{"text":"UNSW, University of Melbourne, Monash"},{"text":"FinTech, CS, data science"},{"text":"University scholarships"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact programme availability and BCA eligibility must be checked individually."},{"type":"h","text":"Application portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong academic record"},{"text":"Python/SQL portfolio"},{"text":"Blockchain projects"},{"text":"On-chain analytics dashboards"},{"text":"Tokenomics research"},{"text":"Financial research reports"},{"text":"Internship experience"},{"text":"Certifications where relevant"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Recommendation letters"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Blockchain/Web3 Student","Blockchain/Crypto Research Intern","Research Associate / Junior Blockchain Analyst","Crypto Analyst / Digital Asset Analyst","Senior Crypto Analyst / On-chain Analyst","Research Lead / Digital Asset Strategist","Head of Research / Digital Asset Strategy Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative technical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Blockchain Analyst","On-chain Analytics Specialist","Senior Analytics Lead","Blockchain Intelligence Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blockchain scalability"},{"text":"Distributed systems"},{"text":"Cryptoeconomics"},{"text":"Token economics"},{"text":"Decentralised finance"},{"text":"Blockchain governance"},{"text":"Digital currencies"},{"text":"Privacy-preserving blockchains"},{"text":"Consensus mechanisms"},{"text":"Blockchain security"},{"text":"Financial market microstructure"},{"text":"Digital-asset economics"},{"text":"Web3 adoption"},{"text":"AI + blockchain"},{"text":"Decentralised identity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong quantitative background can allow the student to move toward cryptoeconomics, financial research or quantitative digital-asset research."},{"type":"note","label":"Evolve and stay relevant","text":"2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The Crypto Analyst role is likely to become increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of simply monitoring token prices, analysts will increasingly evaluate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["On-chain activity","protocol economics","financial markets","AI-driven analytics","regulatory risk"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Future-ready skills should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Real-time on-chain analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Agentic research systems"},{"text":"Blockchain graph analytics"},{"text":"Advanced time-series modelling"},{"text":"Quantitative finance"},{"text":"Risk modelling"},{"text":"Protocol revenue analysis"},{"text":"Tokenomics simulation"},{"text":"DeFi risk"},{"text":"Stablecoin economics"},{"text":"Digital currencies/CBDC"},{"text":"Blockchain compliance analytics"},{"text":"Cross-chain analytics"},{"text":"Financial data engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Blockchain","Finance","Statistics","Python/SQL","On-chain Analytics","AI"],"sep":"+"}]}]}